/article-title><source>Clin Orthop Relat Res</source><year>2007</year><volume>464</volume><fpage>99</fpage><lpage>104</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Yehyawi TM, Callaghan JJ, Pedersen DR, O&#x02019;Rourke MR, Liu SS. Variances in sagittal femoral shaft bowing in patients undergoing TKA. Clin Orthop Relat Res. 2007;464:99&#x02013;104. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17767082</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list><fn-group><fn><p>(Re: Yehyawi TM, Callaghan JJ, Pedersen DR, O&#x02019;Rourke MR, Liu SS. Variances in Sagittal Femoral Shaft Bowing in Patients Undergoing TKA. <italic>Clin Orthop Relat Res.</italic> 2007;464:99&#x02013;104.)</p><p>Editor&#x02019;s Note: The corresponding author of the paper in question was contacted three times with no response. Per our policy, we publish Letters-to-the-Editor without a response when authors have not responded.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>